        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SAHF358, 3-5/8 Inch Large Floor Door Stop with Hook</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis heavy duty floor mounted door stop features a holder / hook to secure the door against the rubber bumper and hold the door in an open position when desired. Packaged with mounting anchors and matching finish screws for easy installation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SAHF358U-specifications.gif?v=1704354562\" width=\"582\" height=\"246\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Solid Brass Floor Mount Bumper with Hook Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: Without hold open hook <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-floor-mount-door-bumper-deltana-dsf3225\"><b>Deltana DSF3225 3\" Door Stop</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-cement-floor-mount-door-bumper-with-holder-deltana-dsf444\"><b>Deltana DSF444 Cement Floor Mount Door Stops</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana SAHF358 Floor Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Height to Rubber Bumper Top: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumper Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/replacement-rubber-tip-for-heavy-duty-door-stops-deltana-dsf-rubber\"><b>Rubber Bumper</b></a>: 1\" Diameter, Black Rubber</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SAHF358.pdf?v=1691095375\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana  SAHF358 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass Floor Mount Bumper with Hook",
                "description": "3-5/8 Inch Large Floor Door Stop with Hook, Deltana SAHF358 - This heavy duty floor mounted door stop features a holder / hook to secure the door against the rubber bumper and hold the door in an open position when desired. Packaged with mounting anchors and matching finish screws for easy installation. Available in 9 great finishes.\r\n",
